@startuml
title Backend Data and Live-Update Communication

left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam roundcorner 14

component "MQTT Processing Service" as MQTTService
component "FastAPI Business Services" as Backend
database "PostgreSQL Database" as Database
component "WebSocket Manager" as WebSocket

package "Connected Browser Clients" {
    component "Registration App" as RegApp
    component "Monitor App" as MonApp
}

MQTTService --> Backend : Validated scans,\ndetections and heartbeats

Backend --> Database : Create or update\nsystem records
Database --> Backend : Query results and\nstored records

Backend --> WebSocket : Asset, node, alert,\nmovement and activity events

WebSocket --> RegApp : Live registration-side\nupdates
WebSocket --> MonApp : Live monitoring\nupdates

RegApp --> Backend : HTTPS command\nor data request
MonApp --> Backend : HTTPS command\nor data request

note bottom of WebSocket
Connected clients receive supported
events without manually refreshing
the page.
end note

@enduml